  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manashe wakadi ne bidimu dikumi ne bibidi hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema bidimu makumi atanu ne bitanu. Dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Hefesiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa, wakalonda malu a bundu a bantu ba mu bisamba abi biakihatabo kudi Yehowa ku mesu kua Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasa bitendelelu bia ku mikuna biakashimbula Hezikiya, tatu wandi; wakashila Bâla ne Bashela tshioshelu bu muakenza Ahaba, mukelenge wa Isalele; wakatendelela bintu bionso bia mu diulu, wakabikuatshila mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasa bioshelu bikuabo mu nsubu wa Yehowa wakamba Yehowa ne, Meme nenjadike dina dianyi mu Yelushalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakashila bintu bionso bia mu diulu bioshelu mu biendedi bibidi bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye kabidi wakahitshisha muanʼandi wa balume mu kahia, wakatempa mbuku; wakadisunguila bena muhongo ne bena buloshi; wakenza malu mabi a bungi ku mesu kua Yehowa bua kumufuisha nʼau tshiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakateka luhingu lua Bashela luakasongeye mu nsubu wa Yehowa, mu nsubu mene wakambila Yehowa Davidi ne muanʼandi Solomo ne, Nenjadike dina dianyi mu nsubu eu ne mu Yelushalema unakasungula munkatshi mua bisamba bia Bena Isalele tshiendelele; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tshiena ngendakasha makasa a Bena Isalele ku buloba ebu bunakaha bankambua babo, biatumikilabo mei onso anakabambila ne mikenji yonso inakabelela mukana mua muntu wanyi Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bobo kabakangunvuila; Manashe wakabenzesha malu mabi akahita a bisamba biakabutula Yehowa ku mesu kua Bena Isalele bubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila dî mukana mua bantu bandi baprofete ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Manashe, mukelenge wa Yuda, wakuenza malu â onso a bundu, wakutamba Bena Amole kuenza malu mabi, wakutamba bonso bakadi ku mpala kuandi kuenza malu mabi, wakuenzesha Bena Yuda kabidi malu mabi ne mpingu yandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nunku Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Nentume malu mabi kudi Bena Yelushalema ne Bena Yuda adi ahatshisha matshu a bantu bonso badi baunvua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nengolole muonshi wa Samalea ha mutu ha Yelushalema, ne luidi lunakateka kudi nsubu wa Ahaba; nenkuhule Yelushalema bu mudi muntu ukuhula dilonga, udi udikuhula, udi udiandamuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nengumushe difuka dia buhianyi buanyi didi dishale, nendifile mu bianza bia bantu badi nʼadi lukuna; bobo nebalue bambudibue ne bahaudibue kudi bena lukuna bonso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua bobo bakuenza malu mabi ku mesu kuanyi, bakunfuisha tshiji ku difuku dinakafuma ne bankambua babo mu Ejipitu tô ne ku dituku edi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manashe wakamatshisha mashi a bantu bakadi kabayi ne bilumbu hanshi, tô ne hakûsheye Yelushalema tente; wakenza malu au ha mutu ha malu mabi makuabo akenzeye ku mesu kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Manashe bikuabo ne malu onso akenzeye ne bubi buandi buakenzeye kabiena bifunda mu mukandu wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Yuda, anyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manashe wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi, bakamujika mu tshibunda tshiandi tshiakadi hehi ne nsubu wandi, mu tshibunda tshia Uza mene. Amona, muanʼandi, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amona wakadi ne bidimu makumi abidi ne bibidi hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema bidimu bibidi. Dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Meshulemete, muana mukashi wa Halusa wa mu Yoteba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa bu muakenza Manashe, tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenda mu nshila yonso ya tatu wandi: wakakuatshila mpingu yakasonga tatu wandi mudimu, wakayitendelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabenga Yehowa, Nzambi wa bankambua bandi; kakenda mu nshila wa Yehowa nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bandi bakelela Amona tshifufu, bakashiha mukelenge mu nsubu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bantu bonso ba mu buloba bakashiha bantu bonso bakelela mukelenge Amona tshifufu; bena buloba aba bakasungula Yoshiya, muana wandi, mukelenge mu muaba wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Amona bikuabo biakenzeye kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Yuda, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamujika mu lukita luandi lua mu tshibunda tshia Uza; Yoshiya, muanʼandi, wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
